.echo === Clash95 bounded day-transition diagnostic v7 ===
.echo Independent 800x600 load-slot0 diagnostic - external stage and candidate SHA binding required.
.echo Forced mechanics: at most five nextPlayer calls with saved GPRs flags and ESP.
.echo Default mode0 observes eight human-banner tests then stops without acknowledgment.
.echo An explicitly prepared mode1 copy may override ONE banner result and ONE release query per button after observation.
.echo All game assets saves and writable state must be in an isolated test WorkDir.
.echo Late-armed input tracing stops its breakpoints after sixteen polls per phase.
.echo V7 records the current OS event thread EIP and ESP without filtering or deduplicating events.
.echo Release-phase input tracing ends at the verified native return before subsequent native work.
.echo Mode0 release observation stops after eight held-button tests. Mode1 discloses bounded query-result overrides - no button writes.
.echo No saveGame calls - normal engine writes still belong only in the isolated WorkDir.
.echo Verified PE-header padding scratch300..33f: state mode advances initialday ESP eax ebx ecx edx esi edi ebp flags tick bannerpolls capturedstate. Extra padding340..34f: releaseactive leftpolls releaseESP and rightpollcount/global override flags.

